<h3>Suggested Responses</h3>

<p>TACOS provides for two types of suggested responses: Resources and Patterns.</p>

<div class="inline-action well">
  <div class="message">
    <h4 class="title">Suggested Resources</h4>
    <p>Suggestions based on specific search terms: <em>aerospace research central</em></p>
  </div>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="button button-primary" href="/suggestions/resources"><%= @resources %> items</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="gridband">
  <div class="inline-action well">
    <div class="message">
      <h4 class="title">Suggested Patterns</h4>
      <p>Suggestions based reguar expressions: <em>(ASCE|asce)(\s)(\d)</em></p>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/suggestions/patterns"><%= @patterns %> items</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
